WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.291
[just an everyday cereal ritual]

00:00:15.251 --> 00:00:16.322
Mrrrhech.

00:00:32.252 --> 00:00:32.674
[suddenly WADE]

00:00:32.674 --> 00:00:33.031
AH!

00:00:33.191 --> 00:00:33.938
[choking]

00:00:33.938 --> 00:00:34.537
Oh!

00:00:34.652 --> 00:00:35.242
So... what?

00:00:35.242 --> 00:00:36.012
Ah, man...

00:00:36.012 --> 00:00:37.942
...you can't just sneak up on someone like that.

00:00:38.641 --> 00:00:40.371
It's all right, man, I didn't mean to scare ya.

00:00:40.371 --> 00:00:41.221
Ah, it's all right...

00:00:41.221 --> 00:00:42.761
...I just almost choked on my cereal.

00:00:42.761 --> 00:00:44.151
Just... don't do it again.

00:00:44.764 --> 00:00:45.333
Sorry!

00:00:45.433 --> 00:00:45.812
Thanks.

00:01:00.912 --> 00:01:01.431
[suddenly RYAN]

00:01:01.431 --> 00:01:01.897
BWAH!

00:01:01.897 --> 00:01:02.827
Sorry, man.

00:01:02.827 --> 00:01:04.237
Clogged your toilet again.

00:01:06.747 --> 00:01:07.889
Hah.

00:01:09.897 --> 00:01:10.408
[suddenly BOB]

00:01:10.408 --> 00:01:10.869
WAAH!

00:01:13.369 --> 00:01:15.361
(Whaaat?!)

00:01:16.039 --> 00:01:17.239
What you doin'?

00:01:19.088 --> 00:01:20.508
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?!

00:01:20.644 --> 00:01:22.684
[offscreen]
We can't seem to figure out how the TV works.

00:01:22.744 --> 00:01:25.221
Oh... Let me come help you!

00:01:26.091 --> 00:01:26.538
[NOPE]

00:01:29.268 --> 00:01:31.747
[static noise]

00:01:42.010 --> 00:01:42.980
Try this one?

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:48.400
(Mark) Guys...

00:01:50.507 --> 00:01:51.237
Guys!

00:01:54.517 --> 00:01:55.436
Good night!

00:02:10.446 --> 00:02:14.079
[increasing confusedness]

00:02:14.079 --> 00:02:14.682
[...also, Tiny Box Tim! &lt;3]

00:02:20.972 --> 00:02:21.346
[suddenly DANIEL]

00:02:21.346 --> 00:02:21.876
WAH!

00:02:24.066 --> 00:02:25.416
Just wanted to uh...

00:02:25.416 --> 00:02:26.476
...see how you do things.

00:02:26.919 --> 00:02:29.496
GET. OUT.

00:02:36.316 --> 00:02:36.753
[suddenly WADE AGAIN]

00:02:36.753 --> 00:02:37.140
AH!

00:02:38.626 --> 00:02:39.306
[punch of friendliness]

00:02:42.747 --> 00:02:44.086
Hah.

00:02:46.846 --> 00:02:50.275
[even more increasing confusedness]

00:02:52.595 --> 00:02:53.285
(Bob) WOAH!

00:02:54.353 --> 00:02:54.933
(Bob) Occupied.

00:02:57.069 --> 00:02:57.789
Wait...

00:02:58.219 --> 00:02:59.489
...do we take our clothes off...

00:02:59.489 --> 00:03:00.586
...before we shower?

00:03:01.706 --> 00:03:02.143
[suddenly RYAN AGAIN]

00:03:02.143 --> 00:03:03.154
I'd say yeah.

00:03:03.394 --> 00:03:05.585
[MAXIMUM CONFUSION]

00:03:07.815 --> 00:03:13.727
[PLOTTWIST - It was all a dream!]

00:03:23.779 --> 00:03:25.553
[ORWASIT?!]

